# Change Safety

1. Inspect existing code before modifying; do not duplicate functionality.
2. Do not delete functionality unless explicitly instructed.
3. Never commit secrets, passwords, or tokens.
4. Run relevant tests after changes.
5. Deploy to preview only after basic checks pass.
6. Update `docs/environment/OWNER_PREVIEW_TEST_CHECKLIST.md` when user-facing workflows change.
